cklink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.hollywoodreporterindia.com/features/insight/top-10-highest-grossing-indian-films-of-2025-from-dhurandhar-and-kantara-chapter-1-to-saiyaara\">\"Top 10 Highest-Grossing Indian Films of 2025: From 'Dhurandhar' and 'Kantara: Chapter 1' to 'Saiyaara'<span class=\"cs1-kern-right\"></span>\"</a>. <i>The Hollywood Reporter India</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">3 January</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Hollywood+Reporter+India&amp;rft.atitle=Top+10+Highest-Grossing+Indian+Films+of+2025%3A+From+%27Dhurandhar%27+and+%27Kantara%3A+Chapter+1%27+to+%27Saiyaara%27&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hollywoodreporterindia.com%2Ffeatures%2Finsight%2Ftop-10-highest-grossing-indian-films-of-2025-from-dhurandhar-and-kantara-chapter-1-to-saiyaara&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AList+of+Malayalam+films+of+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-:Mint-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-:Mint_6-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.livemint.com/entertainment/thudarum-ott-release-date-when-and-where-to-watch-malayalam-blockbuster-movie-starring-mohanlal-online-11748307396455.html\">\"Thudarum OTT release date: When and where to watch Malayalam blockbuster movie starring Mohanlal online\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Mint_(newspaper)\" title=\"Mint (newspaper)\">Mint</a></i>. 27 May 2025<span cla